    <div class="release-panel-grid">
      <div>
        <h3>What changed</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Sync selected libraries from desktop to iPhone for cached playback and prep.</li>
          <li>Use lock-screen playback controls, waveform context, cue markers, and offline audio.</li>
          <li>Queue cue, note, color, and collection edits locally before desktop review.</li>
